&lt;p style="margin-left: 84px; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; line-height: 20px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;２．確定拠出制度&lt;/p&gt;
